    <briefdescription>
<para>Registry of the DAP ids for one stop: stack frame ids and variables references. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classdebug_1_1_variable_manager" kindref="compound">VariableManager</ref> is the only assigner of frame ids. <ref refid="classdebug_1_1_session_1aa25453f6ff0703dd42e955e72d68e5e3" kindref="member">Session::appendStackFrames</ref> calls addFrame for each frame and writes the returned id into the frame object. The registry is cleared at each stop, so an id from an earlier stop is not valid. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
